  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MF7-01 Phase 2: Empowerment and Resilience through Gender &amp; Disability Inclusive Development Lao PDR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Christian Blind Mission (CBM) NZ will work with the Association for Rural Mobilization and Improvement (ARMI) in Lao PDR to&#xa0;improve economic outcomes, food security, and access to disability-inclusive rehabilitation services. The aim is to support women and people with disabilities from marginalised communities to achieve productive, sustainable livelihoods that are more accessible and resilient to climate shocks.</narrative>
  </description>
